WEBVTT

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:04.450
The real fun is just getting started?

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:07.150
Yes... And you can't wait, can you?

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:10.120
To tame a monster, no matter 
how fierce it may be...

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:15.420
The one who achieves victory can be called

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:17.200
a true duelist.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:23.170
This will be a test case to see if Yuya 
can truly become a pro duelist.

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:25.370
Now, show me, Yuya!

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:27.070
Your determination.

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:28.770
Your power...

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:32.380
The entertainment you believe in!

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:39.450
Implementing mass into Solid Vision 
has created Action Duels.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:44.160
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:47.240
the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:25.990
Dragons Unleashed

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:32.710
I know!

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:35.400
I know that you want to become 
the Supreme King!

00:02:35.890 --> 00:02:40.470
You think that if Ray is reborn, 
you'll be rendered powerless again!

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:43.410
Even still, I won't let you become 
the Supreme King!

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:46.720
I won't let Z-ARC's soul awaken inside Layra!

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:49.680
I want you to fight as you are!

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:54.650
And I'm going to use that power, not to 
hurt people or destroy the world,

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:58.120
but to protect everyone's smiles!

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:01.330
I activate Starving Venom 
Fusion Dragon's effect!

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:05.480
Until the end of this turn, 
I steal the use of all

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:07.770
Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend's effects!

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:10.520
Stealing all its effects?

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:12.000
And not just that.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:14.600
I activate its other effect.

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:19.760
And add the combined attack points of 
monsters Special Summoned to your field

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:22.300
to those of Starving Venom!

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:28.890
Scarlight's 3000 attack points and Tyrant's 
3500 attack points added to his own?

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:34.250
Yeah... This is the true power of 
Starving Venom, Joeri's dragon.

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:38.610
Joeri used that power to turn 
countless duelists into cards.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:39.360
But...

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:47.170
I activate the effect of Scarlight Red Dragon 
Archfiend, stolen by Starving Venom!

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:53.140
I destroy all Special Summoned monsters 
with fewer attack points than its 9300,

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:56.980
and for each, I deal Jack 
500 points of damage!

00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:58.700
Wow, Yuya!

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:00.510
He's dragging his own 
monsters into his attack,

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:04.750
to sweep Jack's side of the field 
clean and deal huge damage!

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.890
A little heavy-handed, don't you think?

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:09.590
Jack probably predicted that, though.

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:11.450
Not good enough, Yuya!

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:14.330
I activate Continuous Trap Invalidate.

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:19.270
This turn, monsters on the field 
cannot be destroyed by effects.

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:20.740
Yeah, thought so.

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:32.270
Trying to win by using effects 
stolen from your opponent?

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:33.660
Absurd!

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:34.650
Come at me, seriously.

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:38.860
Prove the power of your 
four dragons in battle!

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:44.460
That's City's pride and joy, Jack Atlas!

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:48.160
He must have anticipated Yuya's 
attack, activated his trap,

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:49.700
and brilliantly evaded it!

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:52.490
I knew Jack would be able to evade that.

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:57.180
And I don't think they'd be satisfied 
ending it like this, either.

00:04:57.180 --> 00:04:58.520
Let's go!

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:01.020
I'm going to combine the power 
of everyone's dragons!

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:08.190
I use all of Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon's 
Overlay Units to activate its effect!

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:10.090
Treason Discharge!

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:12.350
Until my End Phase,

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:16.910
Scarlight and Tyrant Red Dragon 
Archfiend's attack points are halved,

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:21.450
and the total of their lost attack points 
is added to those of Dark Rebellion!

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:27.810
Battle! Starving Venom Fusion Dragon 
attacks Tyrant Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:31.340
If this goes through, 
Jack's done for this time!

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:34.510
Action Spell Evasion!

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:36.500
I negate the attack.

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:39.100
That's the card he set earlier,

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:42.190
through the Stargazer Magician's 
effect that Yuya used!

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:44.360
But what about this next one?

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:51.010
I attack Tyrant with Dark Rebellion Xyz 
Dragon, which has 5750 attack points!

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:54.010
Lightning Disobey of Rebellion!

00:05:56.110 --> 00:05:58.340
If Jack takes this, he's finished!

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:02.090
Action Spell Miracle.

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:05.410
Tyrant is not destroyed, and 
battle damage is halved!

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:09.150
Jack uses another action 
card to protect Tyrant!

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:11.840
But Yuya has two monsters left!

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:14.820
How will Jack evade them?

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:19.120
This time, I'll finish off Tyrant, 
and shave down the rest of Jack's life!

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:21.430
I attack with Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:24.780
Whirlwind Hell Dive Slasher!

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:31.740
Not yet!

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:37.340
I send my still-activated Continuous 
Trap Invalidate to my graveyard,

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:40.230
to halve the battle damage dealt!

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:42.870
You've learned to control 
your dragons brilliantly.

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:44.550
But...

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:48.410
Layra is...

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:54.120
Is Z-ARC feeling Yuya's duel, 
alongside the dragons?

00:06:59.930 --> 00:07:02.160
Now, it's your turn!

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.400
Finish it, Odd-Eyes!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:09.140
I attack Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend 
with Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:07:09.140 --> 00:07:12.100
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:16.880
Action Spell Rejuvenation!

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:19.950
One monster involved in battle 
is not destroyed by battle,

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:22.920
and its attack points increase by 800.

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:32.020
Action Spell Charge Recklessly!

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:34.970
When two monsters do battle,

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:39.870
one monster's attack points increase 
by 600 for the battle's duration!

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:41.840
The dragon helped him?

00:07:46.640 --> 00:07:47.980
Odd-Eyes's effect...

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:50.450
When it does battle with a monster 
of Level 5 or higher,

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:52.420
battle damage is doubled!

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:55.030
Reaction Force!

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:10.970
Yes!

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:12.360
He won!

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:13.670
Gives me shivers!

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:17.340
It's finally... It's finally over!

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:20.720
The huge battle that spanned four dimensions.

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:23.980
The winner is Yuya Sakaki!

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:27.040
Once again, former king 
Jack Atlas is defeated,

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:33.660
but those in all the dimensions 
still felt his blazing heart!

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:34.910
Thank you, Jack...

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:37.960
Thank you, Yuya!

00:08:37.960 --> 00:08:40.180
See? You really can do it.

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:44.840
I acknowledge you, Yuya.

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:48.780
You are those four dragons' master.

00:08:48.780 --> 00:08:54.510
But I have not yet heard 
the cry of your soul!

00:08:59.420 --> 00:09:00.730
Farewell!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:04.860
What was Jack getting at?

00:09:12.470 --> 00:09:13.530
Reiji...

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:23.570
Layra...

00:09:23.570 --> 00:09:25.010
Did Layra smile?

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:27.210
It's as you can see.

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:30.810
When you summoned the four dragons,

00:09:30.810 --> 00:09:33.690
Z-ARC's evil soul began to wake...

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:35.890
But now, she's back to normal.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.360
But she isn't smiling.

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:41.860
In other words, Z-ARC's evil soul still...

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:44.830
It's still inside Layra.

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:48.500
That's what Jack said.

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:51.240
He said I was still lacking something.

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:53.300
But what more can I do?

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:57.340
You have cleared all the hurdles 
I laid out before you.

00:09:57.340 --> 00:10:00.410
I acknowledge your ascension 
from Junior Youth to Youth.

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:06.450
A Youth duelist has the right 
to request a pro test.

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:07.780
A pro test?

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:13.470
I can use that request right now?

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:15.770
No... I can't wait for it, anyway.

00:10:15.770 --> 00:10:18.200
Let me request it right now, Reiji!

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:21.610
I thought you'd say that.

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:26.140
We will now commence Yuya Sakaki's pro test!

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:28.340
His opponent

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:29.810
will be me!

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:31.540
Reiji's his opponent?

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:35.000
A worthy opponent!

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:37.620
Yeah! Burn, Yuya!

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:39.080
Let your blood boil!

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:58.520
I'd like to use an Action Field 
I've been developing.

00:10:58.520 --> 00:10:59.400
Is that acceptable?

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:00.330
Of course.

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:04.480
Then... I activate Action Field 
Performance Coliseum!

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:26.570
Is this...

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:30.470
The place where Yuya first 
fought Reiji Akaba!

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:33.440
They didn't finish the battle then, but...

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:38.140
Reiji wants to continue that 
battle on this stage?

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:48.020
At the time, I still thought of 
Pendulum Summon as mine alone.

00:11:48.820 --> 00:11:52.960
I didn't even think about how 
I was able to start using it.

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:57.110
But now I know...

00:11:57.510 --> 00:12:01.780
The reason Pendulum was born, 
and why I was the first to use it.

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:07.540
A pro is someone complete in all respects.

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:12.740
Until I acknowledge that you have this 
quality, you can never pass the test.

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:14.710
In order to save Layra...

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:16.950
In order to save the world...

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:18.950
You must surpass me!

00:12:21.030 --> 00:12:23.890
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:27.090
Along with their monsters, 
they'll kick the ground

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:28.760
and fly through the sky

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:30.140
to move around the field!

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:33.430
Witness dueling's greatest evolution!

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:34.800
Action...

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:37.060
Duel!

00:12:38.160 --> 00:12:41.200
I'll yield the first turn to 
you, the challenger.

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:43.950
You should lay the strongest 
groundwork you can.

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:46.280
Because I'm going to break right through it.

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:47.980
We'll see about that.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:49.610
My turn!

00:12:49.610 --> 00:12:52.980
I summon Performapal Duck 
Dealer from my hand!

00:12:55.950 --> 00:12:58.220
Why didn't he start with Pendulum?

00:12:58.220 --> 00:13:00.930
Has Yuya become cautious?

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:05.930
When there's a Performapal 
on my side of the field,

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:09.430
I can Special Summon Performapal 
Card Canard from my hand!

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:16.670
Duck Dealer's effect means that when 
a Performapal Pendulum Monster

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:19.640
other than itself is summoned 
or Special Summoned,

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:22.110
I can draw one card from my deck.

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:27.060
I activate my spell card Pendulum Card Burst!

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:31.180
I destroy two Pendulum Monsters 
on my side of the field

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:33.760
to draw two cards!

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:38.570
I set the Pendulum Set with Scale 1 
Performapal Odd-Eyes Seer

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:43.100
and Level 10 Performapal Ignition Eagle!

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:53.270
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 2 and 9 simultaneously!

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:55.640
There's the Pendulum!

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:56.950
Go, Yuya!

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:59.920
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:14:00.390 --> 00:14:02.890
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:14:03.180 --> 00:14:04.720
Pendulum Summon!

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:07.750
Come out, my monsters!

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:14.330
First, the rare dragon with 
two different-colored eyes,

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:16.600
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:20.270
Then Performapal Odd-Eyes Dissolver!

00:14:21.570 --> 00:14:25.280
Tuner Monster Performapal Odd-Eyes Synchron!

00:14:25.940 --> 00:14:28.110
And be reborn from my Extra Deck,

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:32.080
Performapal Duck Dealer and 
Performapal Card Canard!

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:33.870
He summoned five at once!

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:35.290
It gives me shivers!

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:36.650
Hold your horses!

00:14:36.650 --> 00:14:38.620
The fun is only getting started!

00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:45.350
I know that when I'm with you, 
I can make it happen.

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:47.700
A duel that will make Layra smile.

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:52.470
I activate Performapal 
Odd-Eyes Dissolver's effect!

00:14:52.810 --> 00:14:56.760
I can use it and Performapal Odd-Eyes 
Seer in my Pendulum Zone

00:14:56.760 --> 00:14:58.520
as components to Fusion Summon!

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:02.040
Different-colored eyes that 
illuminate the darkness.

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:04.580
Become one with another set 
of different-colored eyes,

00:15:04.580 --> 00:15:06.420
and show the way to a new path!

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:08.650
Fusion Summon!

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:12.260
Appear, Starving Venom Fusion Dragon!

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:18.030
Performapal Odd-Eyes Synchron can use itself

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:22.830
and a card in my Pendulum Zone as 
components to Synchro Summon!

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:27.900
Level 2 Odd-Eyes Synchron 
tunes Level 5 Ignition Eagle!

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:32.410
Flap your beautiful and heroic wings,

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:34.540
to strike the enemy at the speed of light!

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:36.510
Synchro Summon!

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:40.220
Appear, Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:45.290
Last, I overlay Level 4 Duck 
Dealer and Card Canard!

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:50.160
From the black darkness,

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:55.100
the fangs of rebellion that fight against 
the powers of stupidity descend!

00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:56.830
Xyz Summon!

00:15:57.230 --> 00:16:00.920
Rank 4, Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:07.070
Great job, Yuya!

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:09.810
He got out all four dragons 
in the first turn!

00:16:16.150 --> 00:16:20.170
Using the effect of Performapal Card 
Canard, destroyed on this turn,

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:22.630
I draw one card during my End Phase.

00:16:22.630 --> 00:16:23.940
I end my turn.

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:28.810
You gained confidence from using all four 
dragons during your duel with Jack.

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:32.370
You think you can beat me the same way?

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:36.000
Let me test to see if that 
confidence is founded.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:38.040
My turn!

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:43.150
I set the Pendulum Scale with

00:16:43.150 --> 00:16:48.410
Scale 1 D/D Savant Copernicus 
and Scale 10 D/D Savant Newton!

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:54.650
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 2 and 9 simultaneously!

00:16:56.530 --> 00:17:00.000
The great power that shakes my soul,

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:04.310
reside in my body and become the new 
light that cuts through the darkness!

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:06.670
Pendulum Summon.

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:10.280
Appear, my monsters!

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:15.190
The three ultimate gods 
that rule all the kings!

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:19.320
D/D/D Doom King Armageddons!

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:24.690
Those monsters...

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:28.480
Those are the monsters Reiji Akaba used 
the first time he Pendulum Summoned...

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.920
Summoning three at once!

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:32.660
They're as creepy as ever!

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:34.040
Battle!

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:39.140
One Doom King Armageddon attacks 
Starving Venom Fusion Dragon!

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:40.600
Use an Action Card!

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:42.740
Race forth on your roller boots, Yuya!

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:44.780
That way, Starving Venom!

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:48.410
Action Spell Evasion!

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.650
I negate your attack!

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:56.620
Then, I attack Clear Wing Synchro Dragon with 
my second Doom King Armageddon!

00:17:56.940 --> 00:17:58.680
This way, Clear Wing!

00:18:07.300 --> 00:18:10.400
I activated my Action Spell Miracle!

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:14.710
Its effect prevents Clear Wing's destruction 
and halves the damage I take!

00:18:14.710 --> 00:18:16.620
Great job, Yuya!

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:18.180
It gives me shivers!

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:20.600
It isn't over yet!

00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:26.380
I attack Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon with 
my third Doom King Armageddon!

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:29.380
Action Spell High Dive!

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:34.930
Until the end of my turn, Dark Rebellion's 
attack points increase by 1000!

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:41.100
Lightning Disobey of Rebellion!

00:18:45.770 --> 00:18:48.350
Wow! He turned it back around!

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:50.270
Like a horse and rider!

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:53.510
It looks like he really is communicating 
with his monsters!

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:58.720
Thanks, Starving Venom, 
Clear Wing, Dark Rebellion.

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:03.000
Yeah, I'm happy, too.

00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:05.690
That we can understand 
each other like this.

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:08.730
Sorry, sorry.

00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:11.860
Naturally, I haven't forgotten 
you, either, Odd-Eyes.

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.950
This feeling...

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:17.960
I've felt it somewhere before.

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:19.040
That's right.

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:21.190
I am... Z-ARC was...

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:24.240
He wanted everyone to enjoy his duels.

00:19:24.870 --> 00:19:28.340
Not just his spectators, but his 
opponents and his monsters...

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:33.590
But the audience wanted us 
to fight more violent duels.

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:36.050
They cheered for people to get hurt.

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:40.600
That was why we started 
fighting more violent duels.

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:47.560
And then, we... ended up being called devils.

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:53.290
Layra is... crying!

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:59.090
I... What Z-ARC really wanted to do...

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:01.480
It wasn't destroying the world.

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:04.590
It was to fight duels that the audience, 
his opponents, his monsters...

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:06.760
That everyone could enjoy!

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:08.390
Duels that would make people smile!

00:20:11.090 --> 00:20:13.530
Then, make it happen.

00:20:13.530 --> 00:20:15.560
Go ahead and make me smile!

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:16.600
Reiji!

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:21.050
But don't think it will be that easy.

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:25.240
I activate my spell card Dark Contract 
with the Insurance.

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:28.570
This turn, for every one of your monsters

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:31.280
that was attacked without being destroyed,

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:32.980
I draw one card!

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:35.180
Drawing three cards at once?

00:20:35.180 --> 00:20:36.980
Behold...

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:40.150
The ultimate portfolio that I will create!

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:44.480
I activate my spell card D/D/D Fusion!

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:48.680
I use this card and one Doom King 
Armageddon as components to fuse!

00:20:49.650 --> 00:20:50.830
Fusion Summon!

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:57.380
Come forth, D/D/D Super Doom 
King Purple Armageddon!

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:03.040
Then, I activate my spell card D/D/D Synchro.

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:06.280
Treating this card as a 
Level 2 Tuner Monster,

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:09.080
I tune one Level 8 Doom King Armageddon!

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:12.180
Synchro Summon!

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:19.020
Come Forth, Level 10 D/D/D Super 
Doom King Bright Armageddon!

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:23.860
And I activate my spell card D/D/D Xyz.

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:28.080
I Special Summon two Level 8 Doom King 
Armageddons from my Extra Deck.

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:32.340
And I overlay the two Level 8 
Doom King Armageddons!

00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:37.140
Xyz Summon!

00:21:37.570 --> 00:21:44.620
Come Forth, Rank 8 D/D/D Super 
Doom King Dark Armageddon!

00:21:44.620 --> 00:21:47.530
And I activate its monster effect

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:51.550
to add the Overlay Units of the 
Doom King Armageddons

00:21:51.550 --> 00:21:53.480
in my Extra Deck to its own!

00:22:02.430 --> 00:22:05.240
If you want to make me smile, 
from the bottom of my heart,

00:22:05.240 --> 00:22:10.520
you will need to pierce through this 
iron wall lineup I have planned!

00:23:49.000 --> 00:23:50.170
I've made up my mind.

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:53.070
I will make everyone smile!

00:23:53.070 --> 00:23:55.850
So help me out, one last time.

00:23:55.850 --> 00:23:58.480
Joeri, Hugo, Ute...

00:23:58.480 --> 00:24:01.630
Our power already belongs to you.

00:24:01.630 --> 00:24:04.270
We were one person to begin with, after all.

00:24:04.270 --> 00:24:07.800
If you have fun, I'm sure everyone else will.

00:24:07.800 --> 00:24:10.520
I'll see your feelings through!

00:24:11.400 --> 00:24:15.470
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Miracle Drawn by the Pendulum.

00:24:15.470 --> 00:24:17.530
The fun is only getting started!
